					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250523,
					"content": "那您是願意幫忙了吧，真是太感謝了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250524,
					"content": "其實我找人訂製了一組信標，可以自動採集推論必需的原始數據。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250525,
					"content": "為了盡量排除地勢干擾，這組信標最好設置在懸崖、山頂一類的高處。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250526,
					"content": "可我這身材，怎麼看都不是爬上爬下的料…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250527,
						230250529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250527,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250528
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250528,
					"content": "多謝了！採樣地點就在附近，設置完告訴我就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250529,
					"content": "訂製的時候沒考慮這點嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250530
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250530,
					"content": "咳…當時優先考慮儀器的靈敏度了，適用範圍自然就得做些犧牲…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250531,
					"content": "#畢竟原始數據稍微帶些誤差，演算結果就會完全不同啊——總之就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250515,
					"content": "祝你好運，再見。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250516,
					"content": "等、等等啊！您再考慮一下吧，只要我的成果能夠發表，那可是開天闢地的大事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250517,
					"content": "到時候，您就是這篇偉大理論的協力者，我可以在文末的致謝列表裡寫上您的名字…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250518,
					"content": "唔…要不然的話，第二作者的位置也不是不能…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250519,
					"content": "有這麼著急嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250520,
					"content": "要是再拿不出結果，我的研究經費怕是都要出問題…這可比天什麼時候會塌要命得多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250521,
						230250522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250521,
					"content": "「第二作者」就算了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250522,
					"content": "報酬合理就可以。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250510,
					"content": "天應該塌不下來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250503,
					"content": "我很忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250504,
					"content": "哦！請別這麼說，有什麼事情能比自己的居所坍圮在即還要嚴重？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250505,
					"content": "你家屋子…要塌了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250506,
					"content": "咳咳，那當然不是。但如果您住在一座屋子裡，卻從沒見過這屋子的全貌，也沒人保證過屋子的結構強度…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250507,
					"content": "那每天生活在這屋子裡，也是會有不安的吧？那麼住在這個世界裡也是一個道理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				}
			]
		},
