					"nextDialogs": [
						230250808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250808,
					"content": "憑我這副身材，也沒辦法爬到您設置信標的地方去回收啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250809,
					"content": "這次恐怕還是要麻煩您一趟，去收回那些信標了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250810,
						230250812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250810,
					"content": "好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250811,
					"content": "拜託了，旅行者，我會好好準備報酬的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250812,
					"content": "下次可以先考慮好怎麼回收…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250813,
					"content": "我也不是沒有想過，加裝回收裝置啊、拓寬適用範圍啊之類的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250814,
					"content": "但是這一來要更多的預算，二來也不知道會不會影響數據精度…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250815,
					"content": "總、總之這次還是要看您的了，拜託了，旅行者！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
